{"id":"b726984ad897f45b","group":"20","path":"20/20-df-column-thickness.md","title":"按列有限不同与厚子集","display":"df-column-thickness — 按列有限不同与厚子集","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-df-column-thickness","aliases":["20-df-column-thickness"],"display":"df-column-thickness — 按列有限不同与厚子集","chapter":"6","section":"6.5","source_kind":"book-with-local-formalization","verification_status":"definition-checked","source_reference":"Definition 6.5.7","source_printed_pages":[142],"source_pdf_pages":[176],"depends_on":["[[20-df-column-extraction]]","[[20-df-mod-finite]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-df-column-thickness"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-df-column-thickness</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-column-thickness — 按列有限不同与厚子集"},{"key":"chapter","html":"6"},{"key":"section","html":"6.5"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"book-with-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"definition-checked"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Definition 6.5.7"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>142</span></div>"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>176</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"2ca84a186d953c49\" href=\"?note=2ca84a186d953c49\" title=\"20-df-column-extraction\">20-df-column-extraction</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"68ee45ca9dee2182\" href=\"?note=68ee45ca9dee2182\" title=\"20-df-mod-finite\">20-df-mod-finite</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,Y\\subseteq\\omega\">\\(X,Y\\subseteq\\omega\\)</span>；下标 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thick}\">\\(\\mathrm{thick}\\)</span> 是厚子集关系名称的字面标签，不是额外参数。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"2ca84a186d953c49\" href=\"?note=2ca84a186d953c49\" title=\"20-df-column-extraction\">20-df-column-extraction</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"68ee45ca9dee2182\" href=\"?note=68ee45ca9dee2182\" title=\"20-df-mod-finite\">20-df-mod-finite</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}column\\text{-}thickness}\\vdash\n\\begin{gathered}\n\\operatorname{ColumnAgree}^*(X,Y)\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall i\\ [\\operatorname{Col}(X,i)=^*\\operatorname{Col}(Y,i)],\\\\\nX\\subseteq_{\\mathrm{thick}}Y\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\nX\\subseteq Y\\land\\operatorname{ColumnAgree}^*(X,Y).\n\\end{gathered}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}column\\text{-}thickness}\\vdash\n\\begin{gathered}\n\\operatorname{ColumnAgree}^*(X,Y)\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall i\\ [\\operatorname{Col}(X,i)=^*\\operatorname{Col}(Y,i)],\\\\\nX\\subseteq_{\\mathrm{thick}}Y\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\nX\\subseteq Y\\land\\operatorname{ColumnAgree}^*(X,Y).\n\\end{gathered}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>厚子集除每列有限不同之外还要求全局包含；无限多列的有限差异合在一起未必有限。精确对构造只需第一行的按列有限相等，它可以在某列上添加目标矩阵没有的有限个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"1\">\\(1\\)</span>，故不能未经额外验证就称其为目标矩阵的子集。</p>\n<p>来源：Definition 6.5.7；印刷页 142；PDF 第 176 页（从 1 起）。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-df-column-extraction","status":"resolved","id":"2ca84a186d953c49","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-column-extraction]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-mod-finite","status":"resolved","id":"68ee45ca9dee2182","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-mod-finite]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-column-extraction","status":"resolved","id":"2ca84a186d953c49","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-column-extraction]]；see [[20-df-mod-finite]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-mod-finite","status":"resolved","id":"68ee45ca9dee2182","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-column-extraction]]；see [[20-df-mod-finite]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"X,Y\\subseteq\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thick}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}column\\text{-}thickness}\\vdash\n\\begin{gathered}\n\\operatorname{ColumnAgree}^*(X,Y)\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall i\\ [\\operatorname{Col}(X,i)=^*\\operatorname{Col}(Y,i)],\\\\\nX\\subseteq_{\\mathrm{thick}}Y\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\nX\\subseteq Y\\land\\operatorname{ColumnAgree}^*(X,Y).\n\\end{gathered}","display":true},{"tex":"1","display":false}],"bytes":1506,"backlinks":[{"id":"f1ca4420af66074c","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-exact-pair]]；see [[20-df-column-thickness]]；see [[20-df-partial-compatibility]]；see [[20-lem-compatible-cross-search]]；see [[20-df-join]]；see [[20-df-deg]]。"}],"outgoing":["2ca84a186d953c49","68ee45ca9dee2182"]}